  "en": {
    "title": "link - Show the ESP-NOW neighbours and the transfer state",
    "synopsis": "link peers | link status",
    "description": "peers lists the devices this one can see over ESP-NOW, with the local name and channel; status shows whether a transfer is running and how far along it is.",
    "details": "NAME\n  link - Show the ESP-NOW neighbours and the transfer state\n\nSYNOPSIS\n  link peers | link status\n\nDESCRIPTION\n  peers lists the devices this one can see over ESP-NOW, with the local name and channel; status shows whether a transfer is running and how far along it is.\n\nOPTIONS\n  peers\n    List the neighbours (the default).\n  status\n    Show the transfer state.\n\nDEVICE COST\n  One GET each.\n\nNOTES\n  Needs the mesh.peer permission. Read-only on purpose: sending a command to another device turns a typo into someone else's problem, and the confirmation step for that lives in the Vicino app.\n\nSEE ALSO\n  wifi(1), status(1)\n\nEXAMPLES\n  link peers\n  link status"
  },
